<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 239 ALL OUT IN ASIA CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 239 ALL OUT IN ASIA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 239 off 49.5 overs in their Asia Cup match against Pakistan on Monday.</p>
</text>
